      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到这个，我跟你说，NVIDIA最近在IBC大会搞了个大动作，我觉得你应该很关注。",
      "start": 194.505,
      "duration": 7.097,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我看了。IBC是欧洲那个广播行业的年度大展，NVIDIA这次直接把实时AI塞进了直播流程里。",
      "start": 202.098,
      "duration": 8.316,
      "audios": {
