        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "\"实时AI\"是个什么概念啊？咱们平时看比赛直播不也是实时的吗？",
      "start": 210.826,
      "duration": 6.052,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你注意啊，不一样的。咱们说的实时是画面实时传到你这来，但内容生产本身——比如解说、字幕、精彩回放剪辑——这些都还是人工在做，或者事后处理。NVIDIA这次展示的是，AI能在亚秒级延迟下，一边比赛一边给你生成解说、识别关键动作、自动切精彩镜头，还能实时翻译成多语言字幕。",
      "start": 217.357,
      "duration": 23.529,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_022_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_022_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "等等等等，这意思是以后体育比赛可能是AI在解说？那解说员怎么办？",
      "start": 241.318,
      "duration": 9.796,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "哈，别急。我跟你的判断一样，解说员短期内不会失业。但你想想，NBA、英超这种全球赛事，光中文解说就一堆语言版本要配，翻译成本高得一塌糊涂。如果AI实时翻译能做到九成以上的准确度，那这个成本结构就被彻底重塑了。",
      "start": 251.582,
      "duration": 19.176,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这也太……我觉得我现在每看一个AI新闻就想说\"这也太XX了\"。",
      "start": 271.248,
      "duration": 5.965,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "但这背后真不是闹着玩的。你知道这要什么技术底子吗？亚秒级延迟、千万级并发推理，等于是一边比赛一边几百万观众同时在让AI干活，工程栈扛不住就崩了。NVIDIA卖的不光是GPU，是一整套从硬件到软件的实时推理流水线。",
      "start": 277.69,
      "duration": 19.045,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这对行业格局影响会很大吧？",
      "start": 297.153,
      "duration": 3.222,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "非常大。问题是——全球体育IP的版权方、流媒体平台，谁先把这套流水线驯服了，谁就掌握了未来十年内容分发的定价权。你想啊，同样的比赛，A平台有AI智能解说加多语言实时字幕加自动精彩集锦，B平台还是老一套，你选哪个？",
      "start": 300.814,
      "duration": 20.961,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说得好有道理，我都无法反驳了。说到智能体，我得跟你提一嘴通义千问最近发的一个研究。你看了没？",
      "start": 322.187,
      "duration": 9.622,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "看了。Qwen团队这次发的论文是讲数学推理的过程监督——说白了，就是让AI做数学题的时候，不是只看最终答案对不对，而是每一步都打分监督，发现哪一步错了就立刻纠正。",
      "start": 332.302,
      "duration": 15.432,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这听起来像我们小时候做应用题，老师在旁边批\"这一步不对扣两分\"。",
      "start": 348.143,
      "duration": 6.444,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比特别准。传统方式训练AI推理是\"结果导向\"的，答对了就完事了，但中间过程可能完全是蒙对的。结果监督就好比只看卷面分数，过程监督就是改卷老师盯着你每一步推导过程。这种方式能显著降低多步推理的错误率。",
      "start": 355.074,
      "duration": 17.913,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这个对咱们普通人有啥影响啊？",
      "start": 373.429,
      "duration": 2.177,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你看，数学是所有逻辑推理的基础。如果AI在数学这种硬逻辑上能一步步走对，那它在代码、法律文档分析、医学诊断这些需要严谨链条的领域就更靠谱了。等于AI的\"思维严谨度\"在提升。",
      "start": 376.066,
      "duration": 14.735,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "对了，还有一件事你肯定看了——Google AI用生成技术重现了一对夫妇七十年的爱情影像。这个新闻我点开的时候真的眼眶有点热。",
      "start": 391.272,
      "duration": 11.581,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "我懂。这个新闻跟咱们平时聊的\"AI提效\"完全不是一个调性。它是把老照片、旧影像用生成式AI修复、续接、上色，甚至补出当时没有的画面，让一段跨越七十年的人生重新在银幕上鲜活起来。",
      "start": 403.265,
